WEBVTT

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:01.946
We lived in end time.

00:04:01.946 --> 00:04:04.323
We were waiting for things to get so bad

00:04:04.323 --> 00:04:07.868
that Jesus would come back and save us.

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:09.412
The apocalypse.

00:04:09.453 --> 00:04:14.792
It's what the prepper communities are,
well, prepping for.

00:04:15.835 --> 00:04:20.881
And it's why super rich white guys
are buying up tracts of land,

00:04:22.133 --> 00:04:25.469
hoping that they can live inside

00:04:25.511 --> 00:04:29.765
a kind of wi-fi-enabled Noah's Ark.

00:04:29.807 --> 00:04:31.309
(Laughter)